[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":39},["ShallowReactive",2],{"gql:data:FcKFMjCyylAUARVNMlPkYpY9enrLaHcHMfumolptkrE":3},{"contentPost":4},{"landscapeHero":5,"altHoverImage":5,"company":5,"companies":6,"contentCategory":7,"hideDate":13,"date":14,"otherAuthors":10,"derivedSeoDescription":5,"derivedSeoTitle":15,"derivedSocialMediaDescription":5,"derivedSocialMediaImage":5,"derivedSocialMediaTitle":15,"externalLinkUrl":10,"featuredExcerpt":10,"hasDetailPage":5,"heroImage":16,"pageComponents":18,"pdfUpload":23,"pdfFile":25,"pdfFileLinkLabel":10,"relatedContentPosts":26,"slug":27,"teamMembers":28,"tileImage":29,"title":38},null,[],{"contentTopicImage":8,"name":11,"slug":12},{"id":9,"alt":10,"caption":5,"assetUrl":5,"assetUrlXs":5,"assetUrlSm":5,"assetUrlMd":5,"assetUrlLg":5,"assetUrlXl":5,"assetUrlXxl":5},"2429","","Announcements","announcement",false,"2023-10-11","A Statement on Recent Events in Israel | IVP",{"id":17,"alt":10,"caption":10,"assetUrl":5,"assetUrlXs":5,"assetUrlSm":5,"assetUrlMd":5,"assetUrlLg":5,"assetUrlXl":5,"assetUrlXxl":5},"1394",[19],{"instance":20},{"__typename":21,"largeHeading":10,"heading":10,"body":22},"TextBlock","We are deeply shocked and saddened by the horrific events against Israel and its people. We condemn the acts of violence against unarmed civilians and pray for peace. \r\n\r\nOur IVP community has roots in Israel, from our founders and their teams on the ground, to our family, friends and partners who are suffering. The devastation and advancing conflict directly impact so many within our community. Their safety and well-being are paramount in this time of loss and uncertainty.\r\n\r\nTo reflect our commitment, we are donating to organizations that provide humanitarian aid and are helping to secure peace in the region.\r\n\r\nPlease join us in supporting the people of Israel and the promise of peace.\r\n\r\n*Team IVP*",{"id":24,"assetUrl":5},"352",{"assetUrl":5},[],"a-statement-on-recent-events-in-israel",[],{"id":30,"alt":10,"caption":5,"assetUrl":31,"assetUrlXs":32,"assetUrlSm":33,"assetUrlMd":34,"assetUrlLg":35,"assetUrlXl":36,"assetUrlXxl":37},"1393","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1393/Israel_Tile_Image.png","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1393/xs_Israel_Tile_Image.png","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1393/sm_Israel_Tile_Image.png","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1393/md_Israel_Tile_Image.png","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1393/lg_Israel_Tile_Image.png","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1393/xl_Israel_Tile_Image.png","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1393/xxl_Israel_Tile_Image.png","A Statement on Recent Events in Israel",1790351929947]